# Design

The look of this project is one committed file: [`tokens.json`](tokens.json). It names every colour (light and dark), space, radius and
type size the screens use. Screens are built from those names, never from literal values, the way clients are built from
`.ai/contract/openapi.json` instead of from guesses about the API.

